[Tips.InlineScene_S次へ]
effect.name=Specifies the end of the Inline Scene and saves it, then starts a new Inline Scene.\nThe saved Inline Scene can be used via "InlineScene_S Load from Cache".
モード="Temporary Cache" is only valid per scene and is discarded every time the frame is rendered.\n"Long-term Cache" is effective for all scenes and can also be used in other frames.\nThere is no difference between the two for audio.
保存名=The name to use for "InlineScene_S Load from Cache".\nIf it is an image in "Temporary Cache", it can also be accessed from the script via obj.copybuffer(_, "cache:<Cache Name>").
pad::上=Adds padding when positive, clips when negative.
pad::下=Adds padding when positive, clips when negative.
pad::左=Adds padding when positive, clips when negative.
pad::右=Adds padding when positive, clips when negative.

[InlineScene_Sこのオブジェクトで次へ]
InlineScene_Sこのオブジェクトで次へ=InlineScene_S Next from this Object
モード=Mode
一時キャッシュ=Temporary Cache
長期キャッシュ=Long-Term Cache
保存名=Cache Name
余白除去=Remove Margin
除去する=Yes
除去しない=No
上下左右個別に指定=Specify Individually
左=Left
右=Right
上=Top
下=Bottom
追加余白=Additional Padding

[Tips.InlineScene_Sこのオブジェクトで次へ]
effect.name=Specifies the end of the Inline Scene and saves it, then starts a new Inline Scene from this object.\nThe saved Inline Scene can be used via "InlineScene_S Load from Cache".
モード="Temporary Cache" is only valid per scene and is discarded every time the frame is rendered.\n"Long-term Cache" is effective for all scenes and can also be used in other frames.\nThere is no difference between the two for audio.
保存名=The name to use for "InlineScene_S Load from Cache".\nIf it is an image in "Temporary Cache", it can also be accessed from the script via obj.copybuffer(_, "cache:<Cache Name>").
pad::上=Adds padding when positive, clips when negative.
pad::下=Adds padding when positive, clips when negative.
pad::左=Adds padding when positive, clips when negative.
pad::右=Adds padding when positive, clips when negative.

[InlineScene_S読み出し]
InlineScene_S読み出し=InlineScene_S Load from Cache
モード=Mode
一時キャッシュ=Temporary Cache
長期キャッシュ=Long-Term Cache
保存名=Cache Name
位置や回転も復元=Restore Position/Scaling/Rotation
回転の合成=Composose Rotation
音量設定も復元=Restore Sound Volume

[Tips.InlineScene_S読み出し]
effect.name=Loads images or audio saved with "InlineScene_S End", "InlineScene_S Save as Cache" or such.\nPosition, scaling, rotation, and sound volume information can also be restored.
モード="Temporary Cache" is only valid per scene and is discarded every time the frame is rendered.\n"Long-term Cache" is effective for all scenes and can also be used in other frames.\nThere is no difference between the two for audio.
保存名=The name specified in such as "InlineScene_S End".\nIf it is an image in "Temporary Cache", it can also be accessed from the script via obj.copybuffer(_, "cache:<Cache Name>").
回転の合成=Restores the rotation angle so that the rotation is applied in the order of the saved rotation from "InlineScene_S Save as Cache" and the rotation from the output filter.

[InlineScene_S単品保存]
InlineScene_S単品保存=InlineScene_S Save as Cache
モード=Mode
一時キャッシュ=Temporary Cache
長期キャッシュ=Long-Term Cache
保存名=Cache Name
表示・再生しない=Suppress Draw/Play

[Tips.InlineScene_S単品保存]
effect.name=Saves the image or audio of the current object and its position, scaling, rotation, and sound volume information.\nThe saved information can be restored with "InlineScene_S Load from Cache".
モード="Temporary Cache" is only valid per scene and is discarded every time the frame is rendered.\n"Long-term Cache" is effective for all scenes and can also be used in other frames.\nThere is no difference between the two for audio.
保存名=The name to use for "InlineScene_S Load from Cache".\nIf it is an image in "Temporary Cache", it can also be accessed from the script via obj.copybuffer(_, "cache:<Cache Name>").
